      "observed": "The MCU VDD pins are unconnected in the netlist. REG2 output is on +3.3V, while the decoupling and peripheral nets use a distinct +3V3 net; neither net connects to the MCU VDD pins. FCC1 VDDA and NAVC1 VSSA are also unconnected.",
      "expected": "Both MCUs' VDD pins must be connected to the regulated 3.3 V rail, with their analog supply/ground pins connected appropriately. The specification says the 3.3 V rail feeds both MCUs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"+3.3V\") ... (node (ref \"REG2\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"OUT\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"unconnected-(FCC1-VDD-Pad11)\") ... (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"11\") (pinfunction \"VDD\"))"
